    "notes": [
      "The FP32 ONNX file is a byte-identical mirror of the pinned upstream artifact.",
      "The dynamic INT8 artifact is reproducibly derived from that FP32 graph with ONNX Runtime 1.28.0 by quantizing only per-tensor Gemm and MatMul linear paths.",
      "Per-channel dynamic INT8 fails at runtime for higher-rank MatMul on ONNX Runtime 1.27 and 1.28 arm64. Conv INT8, static QDQ, FP16, preoptimized ORT graphs and CoreML were measured and rejected."
    ]
  },
